Hello rgrn! I have some patches for you...

First up is a patch that causes your character to fumble as your
dexterity drops below 10 (and more as dex falls further). In the same patch,
fumble boots and gauntlets now set dexterity to 6 (much as a dunce cap does
with int/wis) and therefore yield effects similar to what they presently are.

Second is a simple patch - if you grease your gauntlets, you will now have
extrinsic "greasy fingers" (the same effect from eating deep fried tins or
using a cursed can of grease).  This has the side effect of causing your
character to be unable to remove greased gauntlets ("You can't remove the
slippery gloves with your slippery fingers"), however you can still abuse
the gauntlets in some fashion to dissolve the grease (fire, fountains, etc.)

The patches are at:
http://bilious.homelinux.org/?245 for the fumbling patch;
http://bilious.homelinux.org/?246 for the greased gauntlet patch.

(I shudder to think what would happen if someone obtains cursed greased
-2 gauntlets of fumbling.)

